     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜まい: I'm not going to (firm negative)",
     "texto": [
      "To say you have decided not to do something: dictionary form verb + **まい**: **もう うそ は つくまい** (I won't lie again).",
      "It is a firm promise."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜まい: I don't think that (negative supposition)",
     "texto": [
      "For a formal negative conjecture it is normally added to the dictionary form: **あの ひと は くる まい** (I don't think that person will come).",
      "It is not combined with **こない** in this example. In the current language **こない だろう** is more common."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
